      "title": "Fixed-path GET routes in notes router must precede /:id",
      "summary": "In src/api/notes.ts, any fixed-path GET such as /count must be registered before router.get('/:id'). Otherwise Express matches the path segment as an id and the handler returns 404 Note not found.",
      "symbols": [
        "router"
      ],
